    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d710">

                <pb facs="0594" n="478" xml:id="pg478"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/11564.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Chargé O’Shaughnessy.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-21T06:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 21, 1914, 6 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>767. We are informed that local Mexican authorities at Vera Cruz are planning to
                    remove Mexican soldiers from Vera Cruz to City of Mexico and tear up track
                    today. Keep in touch with Canada and without giving to Foreign Minister the
                    information received impress upon him the necessity of keeping road to Vera Cruz
                    open for the protection of foreign residents who may desire to leave. Represent
                    to him that this is a matter of utmost importance.</p>
                <p>Senate has adjourned till noon today when House resolution supporting President
                    will be passed, but, as resolution is not necessary to justify the President in
                    his action, he is at liberty to take such action as he may deem proper, except
                    declaration of war, without waiting for the resolution to pass.</p>
                <p>Inform us promptly of any change in the situation. If your communications are
                    interfered with, notify us immediately through some other legation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
